        <item>
            <title>3.23.2</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 21:13:43 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>219</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.23.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- A mirror pane (a session viewed from another Mac, or a pane that re-attaches to a running session) now shows the session's Ultracode state in the model pill and offers the Ultracode toggle. Before, it showed only the model and effort.
- Changing effort, Ultracode or the model in one pane now updates every other pane on the same session, so a pane no longer sends a stale Ultracode setting back with its next effort change.

The fix runs on the Mac that hosts the session, so update that Mac.
]]></description>
